WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:07.067
Roxy placed a mushroom monster into the dumpster.

2
00:00:07.068 --> 00:00:08.719
She closed the lid.

3
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:13.882
"Yes!" she thought. "I think that was the last one."

4
00:00:13.883 --> 00:00:17.104
Honk! Honk! Roxy looked up.

5
00:00:17.105 --> 00:00:20.925
A garbage truck was traveling fast toward a busy intersection.

6
00:00:20.926 --> 00:00:24.217
Mushroom monsters were sitting on top, eating garbage.

7
00:00:24.218 --> 00:00:26.751
More were running behind it.

8
00:00:26.752 --> 00:00:29.811
"Drive faster, Ernie!" Grover yelled.

9
00:00:29.812 --> 00:00:34.502
"I'm going as fast as I can, Grover!" Ernie yelled back.

10
00:00:34.503 --> 00:00:37.815
The garbage truck raced toward the intersection.

11
00:00:37.816 --> 00:00:43.668
The light turned red, but the driver couldn't stop in time.

12
00:00:43.669 --> 00:00:47.322
"Look out!" someone yelled. "A car!"

13
00:00:47.323 --> 00:00:49.829
Ernie turned the wheel just in time.

14
00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:51.661
The truck missed the car.

15
00:00:51.662 --> 00:00:55.082
But it skidded and started to fall over. Boom!

16
00:00:55.083 --> 00:00:57.397
The truck slammed onto its side.

17
00:00:57.398 --> 00:00:59.705
Garbage spilled from the container.

18
00:00:59.706 --> 00:01:04.131
All the mushroom monsters rushed over to eat the spilled trash.

19
00:01:04.132 --> 00:01:09.598
Roxy flew over and pulled the collectors out of the garbage truck.

20
00:01:09.599 --> 00:01:12.694
"Thank you, Rocket Girl!" Ernie said.

21
00:01:12.695 --> 00:01:15.956
"Those monsters were chasing us!" Grover cried.

22
00:01:15.957 --> 00:01:18.786
"We were scared they were going to eat us too!"

23
00:01:18.787 --> 00:01:22.542
"Mushroom monsters won't hurt you," Roxy said.

24
00:01:22.543 --> 00:01:25.685
"And I have a plan to send them back home.

25
00:01:25.686 --> 00:01:27.934
You're garbage collectors, right?"

26
00:01:27.935 --> 00:01:31.524
"Um, yes," Grover said.

27
00:01:31.525 --> 00:01:34.460
"I'll freeze the monsters," Roxy said.

28
00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:36.446
"Then you can help me collect them. All

29
00:01:36.447 --> 00:01:39.705
we need to do is put them in those dumpsters." The

30
00:01:39.706 --> 00:01:42.005
men looked nervous, but they nodded. "We'll

31
00:01:42.006 --> 00:01:50.127
do our best, Rocket Girl," Ernie said. "You

32
00:01:50.128 --> 00:01:54.481
can collect the monsters over there," Roxy said, pointing. "I'm

33
00:01:54.482 --> 00:02:01.033
going to fly over Metro City and look for more monsters." Soon

34
00:02:01.034 --> 00:02:04.151
Roxy was back with a few more monsters. The

35
00:02:04.152 --> 00:02:06.557
two garbage collectors looked proud. "Rocket

36
00:02:06.558 --> 00:02:11.241
Girl!" Grover said. "We got all of the monsters!" "They

37
00:02:11.242 --> 00:02:14.050
turned to slime," Ernie said. "Good

38
00:02:14.051 --> 00:02:16.904
job!" Roxy said. She

39
00:02:16.905 --> 00:02:19.870
added the rest of the monsters to a dumpster. She

40
00:02:19.871 --> 00:02:23.732
picked up the dumpsters and flew to Waxcap Cave. She

41
00:02:23.733 --> 00:02:29.579
put the dumpsters inside the cave. Then

42
00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:35.367
she rolled a boulder in front of the opening. "Whew!"

43
00:02:35.368 --> 00:02:38.742
Roxy wiped her brow. There

44
00:02:38.743 --> 00:02:45.714
were no more mushroom monsters! ***

45
00:02:45.715 --> 00:02:48.557
Roxy hurried into the classroom with her plant.

46
00:02:48.558 --> 00:02:52.004
"You missed our presentations," Terrell said.

47
00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:56.035
"Your bean sprouts must have been, um, super thirsty!"

48
00:02:56.036 --> 00:03:00.731
"Bean sprouts need a lot of water to survive," Roxy said.

49
00:03:00.732 --> 00:03:06.634
Mara smiled. "Miss Apricot said my project was very creative."

50
00:03:06.635 --> 00:03:09.476
"I got a good grade too," Jack said.

51
00:03:09.477 --> 00:03:12.096
"Fungus is awesome! Right, Roxy?"

52
00:03:12.097 --> 00:03:14.707
Roxy smiled. "Right, Jack.

53
00:03:14.708 --> 00:03:20.961
Fungus is awesome, and so are dark caves!"

